{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35697","headline":"水仙操 · 李咸用","name":"水仙操","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大波相拍流水鸣，蓬山鸟兽多奇形。\n琴心不喜亦不惊，安弦缓爪何泠泠。\n水仙缥缈来相迎，伯牙从此留嘉名。\n峄阳散木虚且轻，重华斧下知其声。\n檿丝相糺成凄清，调和引得薰风生。\n指底先王长养情，曲终天下称太平。\n後人好事传其曲，有时声足意不足。\n始峩峩兮复洋洋，但见山青兼水绿。\n成连入海移人情，岂是本来无嗜慾。\n琴兮琴兮在自然，不在徽金将轸玉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35697.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35697","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}